<title>USA: Honeywell, LG&amp;E form marketing pact.</title>
<headline>Honeywell, LG&amp;E form marketing pact.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honeywell Inc said it and two LG&amp;E Energy Corp affiliates have formed a marketing alliance to expand Honeywell's performance contracting offering for building control customers.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, LG&amp;E Energy's natural gas subsidiary, LG&amp;E Natural Inc, will team with Honeywell to provide customers with an alternative way to buy natural gas at competitive rates.</p>
<p>The alliance also will enable Honeywell to offer its customers competitive electricity pricing and marketing from LG&amp;E's power marketing unit, LG&amp;E Power Marketing.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
